            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "Composer-style constraint: *, ^1.2, ~1.2.0, >=1.0.0, <2, !=1.0.0, 1.2.*, 1.2.3, hyphen ranges (1.0.0 - 2.0.0), space-separated ANDs and ||-separated ORs."
